flowchart LR
    I[Freeze Change Intent\nsource + input + environment] --> S[Capture run identity]
    S --> T{Toolchain and\ndependency lock match?}
    T -->|否| B1[BLOCKED\nrebuild in declared environment]
    T -->|是| O[Collect expected outputs]
    O --> L{Every output ready\nand identity-bound?}
    L -->|否| B2[BLOCKED\nmissing or stale artifact]
    L -->|是| R[REPRODUCIBLE\nhand to Traceability / Verify]
    B1 --> S
    B2 --> O
